---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Teyvat Chronicle">
  <div class="about-container">
    <div class="about-header">
      <span class="badge">Fan Project</span>
      <h1>About Teyvat Chronicle</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">An automated archive turning official Genshin Impact broadcasts into structured knowledge.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">
      <section class="info-card">
        <h2>✦ How It Works</h2>
        <p>
          Every 15 minutes, our automated pipeline monitors the official 
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@GenshinImpact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@GenshinImpact</a> 
          YouTube channel RSS feed. When a new video is discovered, the pipeline:
        </p>
        <ol>
          <li>Extracts the official transcript (or falls back to title and descriptions).</li>
          <li>Grounds all terminology using our curated Teyvat lore and characters glossary.</li>
          <li>Synthesizes a structured article featuring summaries, key takeaways, and player impact.</li>
          <li>Generates static Markdown files that build lightning-fast on Cloudflare Pages.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="info-card">
        <h2>✦ Grounding & Editorial Integrity</h2>
        <p>
          Our generation engine is strictly constrained to prevent hallucinations or invented speculation. 
          Articles only describe events, mechanics, and character details explicitly verified in the official broadcast.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="info-card disclaimer-card">
        <h2>✦ Legal & Attribution Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Teyvat Chronicle</strong> is an unofficial, non-commercial fan-created website. 
          Genshin Impact, characters, names, audio, and visual materials are intellectual property and copyright of 
          <strong>COGNOSPHERE PTE. LTD. (HoYoverse)</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          This website does not host copyrighted media files; all video embeds point directly to the official YouTube channel.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-container {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .about-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .info-card {
    background-color: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }

  .info-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--gold-light);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .info-card p {
    color: #cbd5e1;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .info-card ol {
    margin-left: 1.25rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    line-height: 1.7;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .disclaimer-card {
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4);
  }

  .disclaimer-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
